updates these policies as appropriate. SimpleLegal managers observe these policies, procedures, and guidelines 
as well as applicable federal and state laws as they relate to recruitment, selection, and hiring of employees. 
The primary objectives of personnel recruitment are to place the most qualified person available in the vacant 
